6. JOURNAL LINES
================

Each journal line should contain:

* ID
* Journal Entry ID
* Account ID
* Description
* Debit
* Credit
* Cost Center ID
* Project ID
* Batch ID

A journal can contain multiple lines.

Example:

Dr Fuel Expense                 10,000
Dr Labour Expense              15,000
Cr Cash                        25,000

The system must validate:

Total Debit = 25,000
Total Credit = 25,000

This is valid.

Another example:

Dr Cash                         50,000
Dr Bank Charges                  1,000
Cr Sales Revenue                51,000

This is valid.

