11. ACCOUNT BALANCES
====================

Create a reliable account balance calculation system.

Account balances must be based on POSTED journal entries.

Do not calculate balances using:

* Draft journals
* Pending journals
* Cancelled journals
* Unposted journals

The system must understand the normal balance of each account type.

Assets:
Debit increases
Credit decreases

Expenses:
Debit increases
Credit decreases

Liabilities:
Credit increases
Debit decreases

Equity:
Credit increases
Debit decreases

Revenue:
Credit increases
Debit decreases

COGS:
Debit increases
Credit decreases

Ensure account balances are mathematically correct.

