16. JOURNAL REVERSAL
====================

Implement a proper reversal mechanism.

A POSTED journal must never be edited directly.

If a posted journal is incorrect:

Create a reversal journal.

Example original:

Dr Expense 10,000
Cr Cash 10,000

Reversal:

Dr Cash 10,000
Cr Expense 10,000

The reversal journal must reference the original journal.

Add fields such as:

Reversal Of Journal ID
Reversal Reason

Original journal status:

REVERSED

Reversal journal status:

POSTED

Maintain a clear relationship:

Original Journal
→ Reversal Journal

Do not delete the original journal.

